## Import

In Terraform v1.5.0 and later, use an [`import` block](https://developer.hashicorp.com/terraform/language/import)
to import the resource {{ .Name }} by using its `id` with the Palette `context` separated by a colon. For example:

```terraform
import {
  to = spectrocloud_resource_limit.resource_limit
  id = "{tenantUID}" // tenant-uid
}
```

Using `terraform import`, import the resource limit using the `tenant_uid` or `tenant_name` colon separated with `context`. For example:

```console
terraform import {{ .Name }}.example tenant_uid/tenant_name
```

